    {
      "source": "Calling this method sets the <a href=\"ExpressionMarker.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.aot.generate\"><code>ExpressionMarker</code></a> as <a href=\"#isInUse()\"><code>in-use</code></a>.",
      "translation": "调用此方法会将<a href=\"ExpressionMarker.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.aot.generate 中的类\"><code>ExpressionMarker</code></a>标记为<a href=\"#isInUse()\"><code>已使用</code></a>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ExpressionMarker.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.aot.generate\"><code>ExpressionMarker</code></a> is intended to be used via <a href=\"AotQueryMethodGenerationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.aot.generate\"><code>AotQueryMethodGenerationContext</code></a> to maintain usage info,\nmaking sure the code is only added (<a href=\"#isInUse()\"><code>isInUse()</code></a>) when <a href=\"#enclosingMethod()\"><code>enclosingMethod()</code></a> was called for generating\ncode.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ExpressionMarker.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.aot.generate\"><code>ExpressionMarker</code></a> 旨在通过 <a href=\"AotQueryMethodGenerationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.aot.generate\"><code>AotQueryMethodGenerationContext</code></a> 使用，以维护使用情况信息，确保仅在调用 <a href=\"#enclosingMethod()\"><code>enclosingMethod()</code></a> 生成代码时才会添加该代码（<a href=\"#isInUse()\"><code>isInUse()</code></a>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
